*Stinkfly was the first alien [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] named on-screen.<ref name="WBC"/>
*Stinkfly's slime feels like a mix of rubber, cement, and warm oatmeal.{{Refn|''link unavailable''|group = CN}}
*In '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens|Destroy All Aliens]]''''', the texture of Stinkfly's head was taken from a plant, while the texture of his wings was taken from that of an actual insect.{{Refn|'''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens]]'''''|group = AC}}
*Stinkfly's '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''' design was made by [[Dave Johnson]], while his early rendition was called [[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)/Early Development#DragonFly|DragonFly]] and drawn by [[Steven E. Gordon]].

